# Online Question Bank System (OQB2)

Flask web app for managing, browsing, tagging, and generating exam question papers from a library of image/doc assets.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Python 3, Flask 3, SQLAlchemy ORM, MariaDB (pymysql)
- **Frontend**: Bootstrap 5 + HTMX (no SPA framework — server-rendered with HTMX partials)
- **Document output**: python-docx + Pillow + docxcompose (MD pipeline)
- **DOC source / PDF output / DOC thumbnails**: Microsoft Word COM via `pywin32` (Windows-only). PyMuPDF rasterises PDFs to PNGs. See [.cursor/rules/docx-source-format.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/docx-source-format.mdc).
- **Auth**: Flask-Login

## Entry Points
- `run.py` — start dev server
- `init_db.py` — create DB tables
- `cli.py` — CLI (ingest, sync)
- `.env` — all environment config (DB credentials, SOURCE_PATH, OUTPUT_PATH)

