## Permission System (3 tiers)
- `is_super_admin` — god mode, full access to everything
- `role='admin'` in `UserSubjectPermission` — subject admin (can tag, edit, ingest for that subject)
- `role='user'` — can browse and generate documents for that subject
- `role='viewer'` — read-only, cannot generate

Decorators in `app/utils.py`: `@admin_required`, `@super_admin_required`, `@subject_admin_required`

## Question ID (QID) Format
- Past papers: `SUBJ_SOURCE_YEAR_PAPER_QNO` → e.g. `MATC_DSE_2024_P1_Q5`
- Question bank: `SUBJ_QB_DETAIL_QNO` → e.g. `MATC_QB_MATHSMART2024_Q1`

## Asset Files
Stored at `SOURCE_PATH` (from `.env`). Assets are images (IMG, multi-part), Word docs (DOC, single-slot), or Markdown (MD, single-slot), with types QUE/ANS/SOL and languages EN/CH/BI.

MD assets are self-contained (LaTeX math `$...$` / `$$...$$` + base64-embedded images). They render inline on the dashboard / viewer via `app/md_render.py` (markdown-it-py + bleach + client-side KaTeX) and convert to `.docx` during generation via pandoc + docxcompose. Format priority (default `IMG > MD > DOC`) is user-configurable per generation. Optional config keys: `PANDOC_PATH`, `MD_MAX_SIZE_BYTES`.

For the full Markdown pipeline — security model, optimistic concurrency, fullscreen reparenting, cache invariants, common gotchas — see [.cursor/rules/markdown-assets.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/markdown-assets.mdc).

DOC source assets are merged natively via Microsoft Word COM at generation time — `Selection.InsertFile` preserves MathType OLE objects, embedded images, and native tables exactly. The same Word session can produce PDF output via `ExportAsFixedFormat`. Server-rendered first-page PNG thumbnails (cached at `DOC_THUMBNAIL_PATH/<asset_id>.png`) are auto-generated lazily for any DOC slot that no IMG eclipses. See [.cursor/rules/docx-source-format.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/docx-source-format.mdc).

## Runtime Settings
Admin → System Settings (super admin only) is a DB-backed page for tunables — thumbnail width / transparency / Word COM timeouts / dashboard page size / batch-IMG defaults. Settings hot-reload into `app.config` (no restart). Secrets and paths stay in `.env`. See [.cursor/rules/system-settings.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/system-settings.mdc).

## Templates
All in `templates/`. Partials (HTMX targets) are in `templates/partials/`.
`base.html` is the shared layout.

